          "type": "text",
          "value": "Questions from New Patients"
        },
        {
          "id": "f3",
          "label": "Question",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Are you accepting new patients?",
          "group": "1"
        },
        {
          "id": "f4",
          "label": "Paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Yes. We welcome new patients of all ages, from young children to older adults. Book online at any time or call our team during opening hours.",
          "group": "1"
        },
        {
          "id": "f5",
          "label": "Question",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "What does the New Patient Offer include?",
          "group": "2"
        },
        {
          "id": "f6",
          "label": "Paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Your first visit includes a comprehensive examination, 2 intraoral X-rays, intraoral photos, a scale and polish and a fluoride treatment. Additional X-rays or treatment are charged separately if required.",
          "group": "2"
        },
        {
          "id": "f7",
          "label": "Question",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Do you accept my health fund?",
          "group": "3"
        },
        {
          "id": "f8",
          "label": "Paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "We accept most private health funds and claim on the spot with HICAPS, so you only pay the gap. We are a preferred provider for {{site:preferredFunds}}.",
          "group": "3"
        },
        {
          "id": "f9",
          "label": "Question",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Where are you, and is there parking?",
          "group": "4"
        },
        {
          "id": "f10",
          "label": "Paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "We are at {{site:addressStreet}}, Fortitude Valley, close to Newstead, New Farm, Spring Hill, Herston and the Brisbane CBD. Free on-site parking is available for patients.",
          "group": "4"
        },
        {
          "id": "f11",
          "label": "Question",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Can I pay for my treatment over time?",
          "group": "5"
        },
        {
          "id": "f12",
          "label": "Paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Yes. DentiCare interest-free payment plans let you spread the cost of treatment, and you may be able to access your super for eligible procedures through SuperCare. Eligibility criteria, terms and conditions apply.",
          "group": "5"
        },
        {
          "id": "f13",
          "label": "Question",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Do you see dental emergencies?",
          "group": "6"
        },
        {
          "id": "f14",
          "label": "Paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Yes. Call us as early in the day as you can. We set aside time each day for urgent appointments and will do our best to see you on the day you call.",
          "group": "6"
        }
      ]
